      "intro": "Bartholomew[happy]: You must be Edith's grandchild! Bartholomew, bellhop since 1923.\nShe left you the keys, did she? Then you're the keeper now.\nAt midnight the lights come on and the guests arrive. Our job: give every ghost a room they like.\nLet me show you. I'll go first.",
      "tutorial": [
        {
          "target": "queue",
          "text": "Guests wait here. Each card shows what they need."
        },
        {
          "target": "card",
          "text": "This is the Guest Card. NEEDS must be met, LIKES earn a bonus star."
        },
        {
          "target": "room:101",
          "text": "Captain Morrow needs Water. Drag him into the room with the Water tag."
        },
        {
          "target": "open",
          "text": "When everyone has a room, open the doors!"
        }
      ],
      "lockRenovations": false,
      "vaneOfferEctoplasm": 150
    },
